5. Question answering: Question answering systems often rely on understanding the relationships between words and concepts in a piece of text. If token alignment is inaccurate, it can make it harder for the system to provide accurate and relevant answers to queries.

In summary, token alignment plays a crucial role in various downstream NLP tasks and must be accurate to produce high-quality results.
